Headline Generator Project\line }{\afs22\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs22\loch\f5
\line This project is my solution to a project that comprises part of the Full Stack Engineer learning path on Codecademy. The project was designed to strengthen skills in Git, GitHub, JavaScript, and command line.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\sb0\sa120{\afs22\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs22\loch\f5
The aim of the project was to build a message generator program with a randomized output. It required at least three variable pieces of data to ensure diverse possibilities for the output. I chose to create a project that produced absurdist headlines in a fictional newspaper dated within the 20}{{\*\updnprop5801}\up9\afs22\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs22\loch\f5
th}{\afs22\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs22\loch\f5
 century, and given my interest in web design, I chose to display it as a web page, using my knowledge of HTML and CSS to make it more visually interesting.}
